cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or corpus, please cite the paper below."
title: "Fin-SD: Hindsight Self-Distillation for Financial Reasoning"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and corpus for Fin-SD, a localized hindsight
  self-distillation recipe for multi-step financial reasoning in which a model
  localizes the first faulty step of its own failed trajectory, truncates there,
  and distills a hint-conditioned frozen copy of itself into itself under
  reverse KL.
